<title>USA: Fort Bend Cty MUD 42, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Fort Bend Cty MUD 42, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said it won $4.115 million of Fort Bend Cty MUD, Texas, general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 6.0236 percent.</p>
</text>
